- **Unit tests only:**
  ```bash
  pytest tests/unit/
  ```

- **Integration tests only:**
  ```bash
  pytest tests/integration/
  ```

- **A single test file:**
  ```bash
  pytest tests/integration/test_devices_api.py
  ```

- **A specific single test function:**
  ```bash
  pytest tests/integration/test_devices_api.py::test_create_device_success
  ```

